Fri Oct 23 17:13:02 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 20261002.115811.0:
  * rpiboot gains -V/--version and looks up files in
    device-specific folders first
  * Recovery metadata goes to stdout by default on BCM2711 and
    BCM2712; pass -j with a directory to write a JSON file instead
  * Mass-storage gadget runs 64-bit by default on BCM2711 with
    refreshed boot images; legacy 32-bit gadget is gone
  * Compute Module 5 support across docs, examples and
    secure-boot tooling
  * Secure boot: program_pubkey sets revoke_devkey automatically,
    new HSM wrapper scripts, fixed 2712 rpiboot loading
  * Refreshed BCM2711/BCM2712 boot firmware, bootfiles and
    rpi-eeprom sources in the tarball
  * raspberrypi-rpiboot-20240926.102326.3.tar replaced by
    raspberrypi-rpiboot-20261002.115811.0.tar
- Drop obsolete Group tag from the spec file
- Keep plain libusb-1_0-devel BuildRequires rather than the
  pkgconfig form

